{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73081","main_id":73081,"main_title":"林中小曲","main_description":"与桓那兰那的兰加惟谈谈，或许对无忧节的准备有帮助。","chapter_title":"林中小曲","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7308103,"subquest_title":"与桓那兰那的兰加惟谈谈，或许对无忧节的准备有帮助。","talk_id":7308103,"sequence":11,"variant":0,"line_id":730810312,"next_line_ids":[730810313],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20646,"speaker_text_hash":2395192488,"speaker":"兰罗摩","speaker_raw":"兰罗摩","text_hash":316491906,"text":"我们都认识！兰拉娜回来，都跟我们说小那菈的故事。所以，那菈优丹、那菈巴兰、那菈拉娜他们，就是我们的那菈朋友。","raw_text":"我们都认识！兰拉娜回来，都跟我们说小那菈的故事。所以，那菈优丹、那菈巴兰、那菈拉娜他们，就是我们的那菈朋友。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7308103.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-73081","main_id":73081,"main_title":"林中小曲","main_description":"与桓那兰那的兰加惟谈谈，或许对无忧节的准备有帮助。","chapter_title":"林中小曲","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7308103,"subquest_title":"与桓那兰那的兰加惟谈谈，或许对无忧节的准备有帮助。","talk_id":7308103,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":730810313,"next_line_ids":[730810314],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":4227834202,"text":"这样倒也不算是认识啦…","raw_text":"这样倒也不算是认识啦…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7308103.json"}
